# The adapter WEIGHT binary is a build artifact (like model.onnx.data) — reproducible from the
# dataset + seed + config, and recorded by SHA-256 in manifest.json. Provenance that IS tracked:
# adapter_config.json, train_log.json, the dataset, the manifest, and this pipeline's scripts.
adapters/**/adapter_model.safetensors
adapters/**/*.bin
# Local HF tokenizer copies saved beside the adapter (identical to the base's).
adapters/**/tokenizer.json
adapters/**/tokenizer.model
adapters/**/*.model

# Isolated GPU education venv (torch cu124 stack, ~GBs) + transient run logs / caches.
.venv-gpu/
*.log
__pycache__/
